&lt;li class="s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed"&gt;You have strong experience with the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;GCP data ecosystem&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;and proficiency in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;Python and SQL&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
