&lt;div class="s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;It would be fantastic if you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class="s-list-disc s-pb-2 s-pl-6 s-flex s-flex-col s-gap-1 s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed"&gt;
&lt;li class="s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed"&gt;You hold a Master's or Ph.D. degree in Computer Science, Data Engineering, or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed"&gt;You have familiarity with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;W&amp;amp;B / MLflow / Braintrust / DVC&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;for experiment tracking and dataset versioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class="s-break-words s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night s-text-base s-leading-relaxed"&gt;You have experience with&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;containerized environments&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Docker, Kubernetes) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;CI/CD for data workflows&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
