&lt;h2 class="s-pb-2 s-pt-4 s-heading-xl s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;&lt;strong class="s-font-semibold s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;We welcome everyone&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class="s-whitespace-pre-wrap s-break-words s-font-normal first:s-pt-0 last:s-pb-0 s-py-1 @md:s-pt-2 @md:s-pb-[10px] @md:s-leading-relaxed s-text-base s-leading-relaxed s-text-foreground dark:s-text-foreground-night"&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/div&gt;
